      "options": {
        "content": "# QCMS observability\nUse **Service** to narrow the view, or paste an `x-request-id` into **Request ID** to follow one browser request across its BFF and API. Expand a log row and click its `trace_id` link to open the connected Tempo waterfall. Exported fields are SEC-13 allowlisted; answers, direct identifiers, credentials, bodies, headers, exception messages and stacks are intentionally absent.",
